## Checkpoint

| Requirement | Status |
|-------------|--------|
| Stripe keys and webhook secret configured | |
| All price IDs in `.env.local` | |
| Billing page shows subscription status | |
| Plan changes work in Stripe Sandbox | |
| Billing portal opens correctly | |

Run quality checks:

```bash
pnpm healthcheck
```

